    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know. i shouldn't be so dramatic. it's just... when you actually look at the numbers, it's almost funny in a dark way. even if i worked a second job, the inflation just eats it. it feels like a mathematical certainty that i'll never actually own my own life. like the system is literally designed to keep you at zero. how is anyone actually supposed to win when the game is rigged from the start?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
